# Published guidance and per-call evidence
# caption: What it settles. One immutable release per publish, with a monotonic sequence and a hash. New calls adopt within seconds; a live call and every ticket inside it keep the release they started with. Responses keep their state, N/A and customer-unsure are distinct, and AI output never overwrites a newer rep decision.
flowchart TB
    Author["Portal profile, verticals and question authoring"] --> Version["Published coherent guidance release"]
    Config["Canonical config version"] --> Version
    Version --> Cache["Background fetch and latest-ready cache"]
    Cache --> Context["Call-pinned context inherited by work items"]
    Context --> Engine["Existing Assist engine"]
    Transcript["Transcript evidence"] --> Engine
    Engine --> Panel["Rep guidance and checklist"]
    Panel --> Responses["Responses and override history"]
    Engine --> Responses
    Responses --> QA["Scoped history and QA"]
  